---
title: "claim (LegionReferrerFeeDistributor)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused
    q_guard --> q_verifyProof: MerkleProof.verify(merkleProof, merkleRoot, leaf)
    q_verifyProof --> q_checkValid: proof valid?
    q_checkValid --> q_revert: invalid proof - revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_checkValid --> q_calcClaimable: claimable = amount - s_claimedAmounts[msg.sender]
    q_calcClaimable --> q_checkAmount: claimable > 0?
    q_checkAmount --> q_revertZero: claimable == 0 - revert InvalidWithdrawAmount
    q_checkAmount --> q_updateClaimed: s_claimedAmounts[msg.sender] = amount
    q_updateClaimed --> q_transfer: safeTransfer(msg.sender, claimable)
    q_transfer --> q_emit: emit ReferrerFeeClaimed(msg.sender, claimable)
    q_emit --> [*]: return
    q_revert --> [*]: revert
    q_revertZero --> [*]: revert

    note right of q_verifyProof
        INV-001: Merkle proof validates referrer's fee entitlement
        INV-002: leaf = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(msg.sender, amount))
    end note

    note right of q_calcClaimable
        INV-003: Cumulative claim model - tracks total claimed, pays delta
        INV-004: Merkle root can be updated by Legion to add new referrer fees
    end note
